## Reduced Motion

```tsx
useEffect(() => {
  const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches

  if (prefersReduced) {
    // Skip parallax, large transforms, continuous motion
    // Optionally: instant show without animation
    gsap.set('.animated', { opacity: 1, y: 0 })
    return
  }

  // ... full animation setup ...
}, [])
```

---

## Common Mistakes

| Mistake | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| `ease: 'power2.out'` on scrubbed tween | Use `ease: 'none'` — easing + scrub fights itself |
| Animating pinned element directly | Animate children inside the pinned element |
| Not calling `kill()` on unmount | Always clean up in `useEffect` return |
| `ScrollTrigger.refresh()` in render | Only call once, after layout-changing async ops |
| `containerAnimation` without `ease: 'none'` | Required — breaks horizontal sync otherwise |
| Creating triggers before DOM ready | Put inside `useEffect`, not render |
